Oo, walang problema.

644
00:37:26,759 --> 00:37:29,692
Pakiabot po sa akin ang pulang papel.

645
00:37:29,715 --> 00:37:32,115
Sige, pasok na.

646
00:37:32,138 --> 00:37:33,876
Salamat po.

647
00:37:33,900 --> 00:37:36,598
Titingnan ko ang inyong padala.

648
00:37:36,621 --> 00:37:41,028
Ah, ito po ay napakahalagang sulat.

649
00:37:41,051 --> 00:37:43,950
Napakahalagang sulat?

650
00:37:43,974 --> 00:37:45,910
Ano po ito?

651
00:37:45,933 --> 00:37:49,367
Mula ito sa Immigration Bureau.

652
00:37:49,391 --> 00:37:52,724
Kukumpirmahin namin ang iyong pagkakakilanlan.

653
00:37:52,747 --> 00:37:55,645
