704
00:40:02,005 --> 00:40:05,180
Sobrang sakit ng katawan ko.

705
00:40:05,204 --> 00:40:07,898
Ganoon ba? Nakakalungkot naman.

706
00:40:07,922 --> 00:40:10,964
Bago po ba kayo dito sa ospital na ito?

707
00:40:10,988 --> 00:40:13,998
Oo, bago lang.

708
00:40:14,021 --> 00:40:19,454
Dahil bago lang ako sa ospital sa Hapon, talagang kinakabahan ako.

709
00:40:19,477 --> 00:40:21,736
Walang problema.

710
00:40:21,760 --> 00:40:24,006
Huwag kayong mag-alala.

711
00:40:24,029 --> 00:40:28,510
Meron po ba kayong health insurance card?

712
00:40:28,534 --> 00:40:31,471
Oo, meron po.

713
00:40:31,495 --> 00:40:34,695
Kinuha ko ito sa city hall noong nakaraang linggo.

714
00:40:34,718 --> 00:40:36,553
Ito po.

715
00:40:36,576 --> 00:40:38,228
Heto po.

716
00:40:38,252 --> 00:40:40,052
Salamat po.

717
00:40:40,075 --> 00:40:42,120
Aalagaan ko po ito.

718
00:40:42,144 --> 00:40:44,956
Okay, nakita ko na.

719
00:40:44,979 --> 00:40:49,412
Ngayon, pakisukat muna ang inyong temperatura.

720
00:40:49,435 --> 00:40:52,522
Sukat ko po ba ang lagnat?

721
00:40:52,546 --> 00:40:55,585
Paano po ito susukatin?

722
00:40:55,609 --> 00:40:59,622
Gamitin ninyo itong thermometer.

723
00:40:59,645 --> 00:41:02,120
Ilagay sa kilikili.

724
00:41:02,143 --> 00:41:04,743
Naintindihan ko po.

725
00:41:04,766 --> 00:41:07,047
Sa kilikili po ba?

726
00:41:07,071 --> 00:41:11,204
Maghintay kayo hanggang sa tumunog ito.

727
00:41:11,227 --> 00:41:13,160
Sige po.

728
00:41:13,183 --> 00:41:16,317
Ay, tumunog na.

729
00:41:16,340 --> 00:41:18,573
Patingin nga.

730
00:41:18,596 --> 00:41:21,563
38.5 degrees po.

731
00:41:21,586 --> 00:41:24,406
Ang taas ng lagnat ninyo.

732
00:41:24,429 --> 00:41:28,524
Oo, sobrang giniginaw ako.

733
00:41:28,548 --> 00:41:34,194
Ngayon, pakisagutan naman itong papel na ito na tinatawag na medical questionnaire.

734
00:41:34,217 --> 00:41:37,784
Medical questionnaire po ba?

735
00:41:37,807 --> 00:41:40,977
Marami pong Chinese characters dito.

736
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:43,973
Hindi ko po kayang sulatan.

737
00:41:43,996 --> 00:41:45,996
Naintindihan ko po.

738
00:41:46,019 --> 00:41:49,719
Kung ganoon, ako na lang ang magtatanong.

739
00:41:49,742 --> 00:41:52,909
Kayo po ang sumagot.

740
00:41:52,932 --> 00:41:55,265
Salamat po.

741
00:41:55,288 --> 00:41:57,387
Malaking tulong po iyon.

742
00:41:57,411 --> 00:42:01,270
Saan po ang pinakamasakit ngayon?

743
00:42:01,294 --> 00:42:05,097
Sobrang sakit ng ulo at lalamunan ko.

744
00:42:05,120 --> 00:42:08,787
Ulo at lalamunan po ba?

745
00:42:08,810 --> 00:42:11,902
May ubo o sipon po ba kayo?

746
00:42:11,925 --> 00:42:16,597
May kaunting ubo, pero walang sipon.

747
00:42:16,620 --> 00:42:18,454
Naintindihan ko po.

748
00:42:18,477 --> 00:42:21,330
Kailan po kayo nagkaroon ng lagnat?

749
00:42:21,353 --> 00:42:24,787
Nagkaroon ako ng lagnat mula kagabi.

750
00:42:24,810 --> 00:42:27,425
Mula kagabi po ba?

751
00:42:27,449 --> 00:42:30,015
Kumain na po ba kayo?

752
00:42:30,038 --> 00:42:34,438
Hindi po, wala akong kinain mula kahapon.

753
00:42:34,461 --> 00:42:37,339
Kasi masakit ang tiyan ko.

754
00:42:37,363 --> 00:42:41,022
Naku, nakakaawa naman kayo.

755
00:42:41,046 --> 00:42:43,812
May allergy po ba kayo sa gamot?

756
00:42:43,835 --> 00:42:46,293
Wala po, wala akong allergy.

757
00:42:46,316 --> 00:42:50,807
May iniinom po ba kayong gamot sa ibang ospital ngayon?

758
00:42:50,831 --> 00:42:54,564
Wala po, wala akong iniinom na kahit ano.

759
00:42:54,587 --> 00:42:56,521
Naiintindihan ko po.

760
00:42:56,545 --> 00:43:00,483
Tapos na po ang pagsagot sa papel.

761
00:43:00,506 --> 00:43:02,483
Salamat po.

762
00:43:02,507 --> 00:43:05,311
Mabuti at mabait ka.

763
00:43:05,334 --> 00:43:08,368
Walang anuman.

764
00:43:08,391 --> 00:43:12,288
Diyan ka na sa sopa, maupo ka na.

765
00:43:12,311 --> 00:43:17,344
Tatawagin ka ng guro, maghintay ka lang.

766
00:43:17,367 --> 00:43:19,946
Opo, naiintindihan ko na.

767
00:43:19,970 --> 00:43:22,304
Naghihintay na lang ako dito.